# name: Groups and indents all following output by an additional level, until console.groupEnd() is called
# key: cgr
# uuid: cgr
# --
console.group('${label}')`(if (eolp) (js-react-redux-yasnippets-semicolon))`
\cdot cin
# name: Displays a message in the console but also displays a blue information icon along with the logged message
# key: cin
# uuid: cin
# --
console.info(${object})`(if (eolp) (js-react-redux-yasnippets-semicolon))`
